      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "using Semantic segmentation using\nMask R-CNN / U-Net / SAM to segment \neach buildings in the image \n\nMeta's Segment Anything Model(SAM)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
