      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788193722712,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Airspace & Height-Restriction Compliance Check (AAI/NOC Zones)",
      "fontSize": 39.398306615634226,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Airspace & Height-Restriction Compliance Check (AAI/NOC Zones)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0hpnL8Lj2I_7yjHOIxkii",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -8221.969209385381,
      "y": -12112.432325942558,
      "width": 1544.451733539396,
      "height": 246.23941634771393,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3T",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2029720571,
      "version": 676,
      "versionNonce": 1862087951,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788193722712,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Buildings near airports need height clearance from the Airports\nAuthority of India (AAI) — there are legally defined height-restriction\nzones (color-coded surfaces around every airport). Cross-reference your\nestimated building height + GPS location against AAI's published\nheight-restriction zone maps.",
      "fontSize": 39.398306615634226,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Buildings near airports need height clearance from the Airports Authority of India (AAI) — there are legally defined height-restriction zones (color-coded surfaces around every airport). Cross-reference your estimated building height + GPS location against AAI's published height-restriction zone maps.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "zdPQkPrjmze06-SB08mU6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -8225.130549363512,
      "y": -11835.654733585734,
      "width": 1646.501220703125,
      "height": 49.24788326954278,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3W",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2133921429,
      "version": 780,
      "versionNonce": 114408239,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788193722712,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Common/Shared Area Fractional ULPIN (Staircases, Lifts, Terrace, Parking)",
      "fontSize": 39.398306615634226,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. Common/Shared Area Fractional ULPIN (Staircases, Lifts, Terrace, Parking)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "MacrEE6Pmnq3ObZ4_RhW2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -8226.663222908435,
      "y": -11758.694904914384,
      "width": 1566.7510692778455,
      "height": 246.23941634771393,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3X",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 320639291,
      "version": 753,
      "versionNonce": 1517321551,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788193722712,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Right now your ULPIN hierarchy is Parcel → Building → Floor → Unit. But\nin Indian apartment law (Apartment Ownership Act), staircases, lifts,\nterraces, and parking are undivided shared property — jointly owned by\nall unit owners in fixed percentage shares, not owned by any single\nunit.",
      "fontSize": 39.398306615634226,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Right now your ULPIN hierarchy is Parcel → Building → Floor → Unit. But in Indian apartment law (Apartment Ownership Act), staircases, lifts, terraces, and parking are undivided shared property — jointly owned by all unit owners in fixed percentage shares, not owned by any single unit.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "3x-jINd_2UESO7WEx8MFV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -8218.93891368564,
      "y": -11495.783045182197,
      "width": 1429.8564453125,
      "height": 49.24788326954278,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3b",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1114619515,
      "version": 749,
      "versionNonce": 1831992175,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788193722712,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. Satellite-Derived Hazard Zone Overlay (Structural Risk Tagging)",
      "fontSize": 39.398306615634226,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. Satellite-Derived Hazard Zone Overlay (Structural Risk Tagging)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "f617A1HWoejUGMot9cE0V",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -8231.906726786523,
      "y": -11445.681625646164,
      "width": 1494.928153501452,
      "height": 246.23941634771393,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3c",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 743291573,
      "version": 715,
      "versionNonce": 1130280335,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788193722712,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Since you already pull DEM/DSM from Bhuvan/SRTM, also overlay your 3D\nparcels against existing satellite-derived hazard layers — flood\nzones (CWC/NRSC flood atlas), seismic zones (BIS seismic zoning map),\nor landslide-prone zones — and tag each ULPIN with a computed risk\nflag.",
      "fontSize": 39.398306615634226,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Since you already pull DEM/DSM from Bhuvan/SRTM, also overlay your 3D parcels against existing satellite-derived hazard layers — flood zones (CWC/NRSC flood atlas), seismic zones (BIS seismic zoning map), or landslide-prone zones — and tag each ULPIN with a computed risk flag.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ZgrW9dd-kvq2BJeBjGlTM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -8236.256660232806,
      "y": -11199.071119831457,
      "width": 1538.178955078125,
      "height": 49.24788326954278,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
