      "updated": 1788184307384,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Take underground sensing data, detect likely utility\nsignals, determine their approximate location/depth,\nconnect those detections into utility lines, and put the\nvalidated utilities into the same 3D GIS environment as\nbuildings and parcels.",
      "fontSize": 23.28997617428678,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Take underground sensing data, detect likely utility signals, determine their approximate location/depth, connect those detections into utility lines, and put the validated utilities into the same 3D GIS environment as buildings and parcels.",
